WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.203
Toad struggled under his friends.

2
00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:22.672
"Get off me!" he screamed.

3
00:00:22.673 --> 00:00:26.822
"You have no right! Help! Help!"

4
00:00:26.823 --> 00:00:30.219
"Hold still, Toad," said Mole.

5
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:35.964
Finally they got Toad out of his coat and cap.

6
00:00:35.965 --> 00:00:39.944
The goggles and gloves lay on the floor.

7
00:00:39.945 --> 00:00:43.268
"Now stand up, Toad," said Mole.

8
00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:46.147
"You look like yourself again."

9
00:00:46.148 --> 00:00:49.871
Toad calmed down.

10
00:00:49.872 --> 00:00:53.751
In fact, he even giggled a little.

11
00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:57.738
"Toad, you knew we would come," said Badger.

12
00:00:57.739 --> 00:01:00.337
"We warned you!" said Rat.

13
00:01:00.338 --> 00:01:04.478
"You are spending all your money," said Mole.

14
00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:06.542
"But . . . ," said Toad.

15
00:01:06.543 --> 00:01:10.672
"You are getting a bad name," said Badger.

16
00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:13.135
"But . . . ," said Toad.

17
00:01:13.136 --> 00:01:16.542
"The police are always after you," said Rat.

18
00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.203
"But . . . ," said Toad.

19
00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:25.000
"You are a terrible driver!" cried Mole.

20
00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:28.827
Toad looked down sadly.

21
00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:32.469
"Toad, we don't think you're bad," said Rat.

22
00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:36.734
"But you must give up your cars," said Badger.

23
00:01:36.735 --> 00:01:41.208
"Then everything will be right again," said Mole.

24
00:01:41.209 --> 00:01:45.735
Badger put his hand on Toad's shoulder.

25
00:01:45.736 --> 00:01:49.614
"Let's go into the next room," he said.

26
00:01:49.615 --> 00:01:53.800
"We won't come out until you make a promise.

27
00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:58.150
You must promise to stop driving."

28
00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:02.433
Badger led Toad into the next room.

29
00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:05.128
He closed the door.

30
00:02:05.129 --> 00:02:08.116
"It's useless," sighed Rat.

31
00:02:08.117 --> 00:02:10.640
"Talking does nothing.

32
00:02:10.641 --> 00:02:14.497
Toad will say anything!"
